# External / scratch model artifacts dropped at repo root.
#
# NOTE for anyone extending this file: since Prettier 3.0, --ignore-path
# defaults to BOTH .gitignore and .prettierignore, so anything already
# gitignored is skipped without a line here. Verified against the pinned
# Prettier 3.9.6: a badly-formatted JSON file under a gitignore-only directory
# is passed over, while a byte-identical one outside it is flagged. Do not
# mirror gitignore rules into this file — only paths that are NOT gitignored
# (or are gitignored via an untracked nested .gitignore) need an entry.
#
# The scratch model packages, path_c_v24c/ and .remember/ used to be listed
# here for exactly that reason and are now covered by the root .gitignore, so
# their duplicate entries are gone. microtubules_v7_pysoax/ has no .gitignore
# rule, so it keeps its own. (A few older duplicates survive further down —
# harmless, just noise.)
microtubules_v7_pysoax/

# Python virtualenvs (see .gitignore)
